---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us - TypingWire Editorial & Speed Portal"
  description="Learn more about TypingWire, our mission to improve typing productivity, and our editorial standards for keyboard and typing exam guides."
>
  <div class="prose-container about-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="current">About</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-tags">
      <span class="post-card-badge badge-mint">ABOUT TYPINGWIRE</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display-lg">Empowering Typists with Speed, Precision & Science.</h1>

    <p class="lead-text">
      TypingWire is India's leading platform dedicated to touch-typing mastery, government typing exam preparation (SSC, High Court, Steno, DSSSB), and mechanical keyboard insights.
    </p>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <div class="article-content">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        Typing is the primary interface between human thought and the digital world. Our mission is to help students, programmers, legal professionals, and writers double their typing speed, eliminate fatigue, and pass competitive government typing tests with 100% confidence.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <div class="coverage-grid">
        <div class="coverage-card">
          <span class="card-icon">⚡</span>
          <h3>Speed & Muscle Memory</h3>
          <p>Scientific touch-typing drills, n-gram exercises, and home-row finger mechanics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="coverage-card">
          <span class="card-icon">⚖️</span>
          <h3>Exam Rules & Guidelines</h3>
          <p>Full mistake vs half mistake formulas for SSC CGL, CHSL, High Court, and Stenography tests.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="coverage-card">
          <span class="card-icon">⌨️</span>
          <h3>Hardware & Switches</h3>
          <p>Objective reviews of mechanical switches, ergonomic layouts, and tactile actuation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Part of the TypingWire Ecosystem</h2>
      <p>
        This blog portal is the official editorial knowledge wing of <a href="https://typingwire.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-bold">TypingWire.in</a>, where thousands of aspirants practice daily on live exam-simulated typing software.
      </p>

      <div class="mint-cta-block">
        <h3>Ready to Test Your Speed?</h3>
        <p>Take a 60-second typing test on TypingWire with instant error analysis and WPM breakdown.</p>
        <a href="https://typingwire.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button-primary">
          Launch TypingWire App →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--colors-muted-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--colors-primary);
  }

  .header-tags {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--colors-muted-text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .section-divider {
    border: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--colors-hairline);
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .coverage-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .coverage-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--colors-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--colors-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-md);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 24px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .coverage-card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--colors-primary);
  }

  .coverage-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colors-muted-text);
  }

  .link-bold {
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    color: var(--colors-primary);
  }

  .mint-cta-block {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    background-color: var(--colors-block-mint);
    border: 1px solid #bbf7e6;
    border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
  }

  .mint-cta-block h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: #064e3b;
  }

  .mint-cta-block p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: #047857;
  }
</style>
